Short:        Complex number functions for C
Author:       daltern@ic.ac.uk (Nick d'Alterio)
Uploader:     daltern ic ac uk (Nick d\\'Alterio)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

A set of functions to carry out the basic complex number
operations in C. Includes-

Add
Subtract
Divide
Multiply
Modulus
Argument
